// # openOODA CLI Token — Anchor for Agents
//
// Logline: Token router. cli token <sub> forwards to tui --token <sub>.
//
// Setup: spawn() runs tui. Args append after --token.
//
// Beats:
//   1. token.oo builds ["--token", <rest...>] and spawn("tui", ...).
//
// Forwarder is cli/token.oo, imported from main.oo.
